<title>USA: Office Depot to open 40 new stores in 1997.</title>
<headline>Office Depot to open 40 new stores in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Office Depot Inc said on Thursday that it expects to open 40 new stores in 1997 and at least 80 stores in 1998.</p>
<p>The company said it opened four new office products superstores, including two stores in California, one in Illinois and another in Ohio, ending the quarter with a total of 575 stores throughout the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>Office Depot said it continued to expand internationally, with additional locations opening in both France and Mexico.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
